{"id":"reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as","date":"2026-10-20","topic":"apps","region":"americas","headline":"How Instagram Started as an Unpopular Check-In App","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Instagram"},"accent":"uk","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Kevin Systrom and Mike Krieger made a phone program.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.23,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.52,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.96,1.4,1.7,2.36,2.8,3.1,3.36]},{"text":"Few people used their busy phone program called Burbn.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.8,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":5.62,"times":[0.14,0.14,0.48,0.9,1.28,1.52,1.94,2.52,2.94]},{"text":"However, the users loved sharing pictures with friends.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t1-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.76,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.72,"times":[0.0,0.64,0.74,1.08,1.54,2.16,2.66,3.02]},{"text":"The two creators removed all the extra tools.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.35,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.74,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.22,0.68,1.32,1.92,2.16,2.44]},{"text":"They started Instagram for sharing simple photos in October 2010.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.49,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":6.81,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.54,1.16,1.72,1.98,2.48,3.0,3.52,3.98]}],"bands":{"core1000":76,"core1800":16,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"Few people","title":"Quantifier Few","note":"The word 'few' means almost none and gives a negative impression. It shows that very few users actually used the original program."},{"i":2,"focus":"loved sharing","title":"Gerund After Verb","note":"The verb 'love' can be followed by a gerund ending in '-ing'. Here, 'sharing' functions as the object of what they loved."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Kevin Systrom and Mike Krieger created a phone software program named Burbn.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.88,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.52,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.88,1.24,1.5,2.12,2.78,3.04,3.26,3.7,4.38,4.92]},{"text":"Few people used it because the program had too many crowded features.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.28,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.83,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.5,0.8,1.06,1.48,1.64,1.96,2.34,2.58,2.88,3.34]},{"text":"But the creators noticed that users loved sharing their personal photos.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t2-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","M","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.54,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":7.32,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.2,0.54,1.1,1.46,1.74,2.24,2.76,3.24,3.66]},{"text":"So Systrom and Krieger removed all of the unnecessary extra tools.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t2-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.6,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.37,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.56,0.86,1.28,1.74,2.36,2.5,2.62,3.1,3.7]},{"text":"They kept photo filters, comments, likes, and a new simple name.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.01,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":7.55,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.28,0.66,1.58,2.38,2.58,3.38,3.5,3.74,4.16]},{"text":"They launched Instagram in October 2010, and it will remain famous.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","V","C"],"dur":5.3,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":7.19,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.32,0.96,1.46,1.84,3.26,3.44,3.54,3.68,4.0]}],"bands":{"core1000":76,"core1800":17,"ngsl":2,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"because","title":"Subordinating Conjunction Because","note":"The conjunction 'because' connects a main clause with a clause stating a reason. It explains why people rarely used the software."},{"i":5,"focus":"will remain famous","title":"Linking Verb with Future Tense","note":"The modal verb 'will' combines with the linking verb 'remain' to state a future condition. The adjective 'famous' serves as a subject complement."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Kevin Systrom and Mike Krieger built Burbn, a location check-in app for sharing positions.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.88,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":8.61,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.9,1.36,1.66,2.24,2.78,4.06,4.12,4.64,5.16,5.34,5.7,5.98]},{"text":"Very few people used the main service because it felt far too crowded.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","S","V","C","C","C"],"dur":4.53,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":6.2,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.52,0.94,1.26,1.52,1.68,2.06,2.74,2.88,3.1,3.62,3.82]},{"text":"However, the small group of active users clearly enjoyed sharing their photos.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t3-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.99,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.27,"times":[0.0,0.72,0.84,1.1,1.42,1.6,1.96,2.4,2.96,3.48,3.98,4.26]},{"text":"Therefore, Systrom and Krieger decided to strip away almost all extra features.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.69,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.01,"times":[0.0,0.66,1.18,1.54,1.92,2.54,2.9,3.16,3.5,4.0,4.44,4.84]},{"text":"They focused entirely on photos, digital filters, user comments, and simple likes.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.11,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":8.33,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.38,0.92,1.48,2.34,2.68,3.6,3.98,4.84,5.06,5.42]},{"text":"The creators officially launched Instagram in October 2010, which became an instant success.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","M","M","M","S","V","C","C","C"],"dur":6.27,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.59,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.4,0.96,1.5,2.04,2.5,2.68,4.18,4.34,4.62,4.96,5.36]},{"text":"Millions of people have downloaded this simplified photo platform since that time.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.97,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":6.87,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.58,0.88,1.12,1.6,1.96,2.38,2.86,3.34,3.9,4.16]}],"bands":{"core1000":71,"core1800":14,"ngsl":5,"tsl":4,"nawl":0,"beyond":6},"grammar":[{"i":5,"focus":"which became an instant success","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"The relative pronoun 'which' introduces additional information about the launch. Non-defining clauses are offset by commas and can be removed without changing the core meaning."},{"i":6,"focus":"have downloaded","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect 'have downloaded' shows an action that began in the past and continues to be relevant up to the present. It links past activity with current results."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Long before becoming a global social network, Instagram began as a location-sharing service named Burbn.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.63,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.18,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.54,1.16,1.42,1.7,2.2,3.36,3.78,4.42,4.78,4.88,5.74,6.32,6.76]},{"text":"The initial application was developed in San Francisco by Kevin Systrom and Mike Krieger.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.59,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":6.26,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.8,1.26,1.56,1.88,2.12,2.64,3.3,3.62,4.16,4.58,4.88]},{"text":"However, the software was considered overcrowded, and very few individuals actively used its primary features.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","V","C","M","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O"],"dur":6.97,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":8.35,"times":[0.0,0.54,0.68,0.96,1.34,1.74,3.2,3.24,3.46,3.78,4.5,4.98,5.42,5.72,6.02]},{"text":"The co-founders observed that early users were mostly interested in uploading and sharing personal photographs.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","S","S","V","M","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.29,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":8.01,"times":[0.0,0.15,0.62,1.0,1.32,1.6,2.02,2.3,2.56,3.0,3.44,3.88,4.34,4.62,5.12]},{"text":"Recognizing this clear pattern, Systrom and Krieger decided to modify their whole product strategy.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.72,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.96,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.76,0.96,1.78,2.22,2.56,2.92,3.3,3.58,3.86,4.38,4.58,4.94]},{"text":"All unnecessary capabilities were removed, leaving only photo editing filters, user comments, and likes.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.59,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.89,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.54,1.42,1.8,2.8,2.88,3.26,3.6,3.96,4.9,5.16,5.9,6.02]},{"text":"The streamlined service was renamed Instagram, blending the words instant camera and telegram together.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","C","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.22,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.24,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.94,1.18,1.52,2.9,3.1,3.4,3.58,4.08,4.5,5.04,5.48]},{"text":"When the platform was officially launched in October 2010, it gained rapid popularity among users.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t4-7.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","V","V","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.09,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":7.81,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.24,0.48,0.78,1.12,1.5,1.82,2.16,3.42,3.48,3.66,4.1,4.56,5.12]}],"bands":{"core1000":67,"core1800":14,"ngsl":6,"tsl":7,"nawl":0,"beyond":6},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"was developed","title":"Passive Voice","note":"Passive voice shifts focus to the receiver of the action, 'the initial application'. It uses a form of 'be' followed by a past participle."},{"i":4,"focus":"Recognizing this clear pattern","title":"Present Participle Modifier","note":"An '-ing' clause at the beginning of a sentence acts as an adverbial modifier. It explains the reason or background before the subject performs the main verb."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Before evolving into a global social media juggernaut, Instagram began as an overly complex location-sharing application known as Burbn.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.25,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.7,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.98,1.34,1.52,1.88,2.3,2.8,3.88,4.3,4.9,5.2,5.28,5.5,6.04,7.2,7.76,8.22,8.54]},{"text":"Developed in San Francisco by Kevin Systrom and Mike Krieger, the original mobile platform struggled with low user engagement.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.79,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.52,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.56,0.76,1.22,1.64,1.86,2.44,2.74,2.98,4.04,4.12,4.42,4.76,5.32,5.84,6.28,6.5,6.86]},{"text":"Upon reviewing user behavior, the founders discovered an intriguing pattern: people consistently ignored check-ins while frequently posting photos.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","S","M","V","O","M","M","V","O"],"dur":4.19,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":5.67,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.54,0.92,1.88,1.96,2.2,2.64,2.96,3.32,3.36,3.4,3.46,3.5,3.55,3.58,3.64,3.68]},{"text":"Recognizing that extreme simplicity was essential for success, Systrom and Krieger decided to radically redesign their product.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.59,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":5.53},{"text":"The duo made a deliberate decision to strip away nearly all existing features from their cluttered original prototype.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.67,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":8.67},{"text":"Instead, they concentrated exclusively on a smooth photo-sharing experience enhanced by digital filters, user comments, and basic likes.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":15.84,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":8.18,"times":[6.94,7.66,7.8,8.16,8.78,9.48,9.56,9.97,10.8,11.48,12.1,12.48,12.8,13.7,13.92,14.76,14.88,15.18]},{"text":"Rebranded as Instagram—a portmanteau blending instant camera and telegram—the refocused platform was officially introduced in October 2010.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-6.m4a","dur":9.1,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":10.65,"times":[0.0,0.42,0.74,1.88,2.52,2.72,3.26,3.8,4.12,5.28,5.72,6.14,6.46,6.8,7.42,7.76,8.0]},{"text":"Within just two months of its public launch, the minimalist image-centric app attracted one million registered users worldwide.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/t5-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M"],"dur":7.73,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-how-instagram-started-as/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":21.19,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.42,0.8,1.06,1.32,1.42,1.68,2.54,2.56,3.11,3.8,4.12,4.56,4.96,5.44,5.8,6.28]}],"bands":{"core1000":60,"core1800":14,"ngsl":7,"tsl":6,"nawl":0,"beyond":13},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"Developed in San Francisco by Kevin Systrom and Mike Krieger","title":"Past Participle Introductory Phrase","note":"A pas